Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.68,0:01:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the return of\NCrimson Supernova Monami,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.90,0:01:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maid Alien plans to raid\Nthe Oinky Doink Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.02,0:01:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, an internal leak drags\Nthe police into the picture,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.08,0:01:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and in raids, Monami tracks\Ndown the rat who squealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.10,0:01:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is none other than Nerula,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.88,0:01:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who swore an oath of sisterhood\Nwith a maid from the Oinky Doink.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.38,0:01:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monami executes Nerula\Nin a flash of gunfire,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.68,0:01:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leading her to die in the\Narms of her hopeless sister.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.39,0:02:02.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(425.6,580.8)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Creature Gang War Chronicles:
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.39,0:02:02.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(806.2,767)\fnPapyrus\fs60}The Bloody Extra-Akiba Terrestrial Showdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.34,0:02:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A week after the gunning\Ndown of an Akiba maid,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.32,0:02:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a maid who claims to be\Nresponsible has turned
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.64,0:02:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,herself into the Akihabara police station.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The suspect is the manager of\Nthe cafe where the victim worked,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.24,0:02:24.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(576,638.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41\c&H00FFFF&}ARRESTED: On Suspicion of Murder
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.24,0:02:24.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(570.8,688.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Manager of Invader Café Destron
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.24,0:02:31.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1410,262)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Maid
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.24,0:02:31.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1337.2,314)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Gunned Down
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.34,0:02:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and according to police,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.78,0:02:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she is repeating nonsense such as,\Nthe cosmos vanished from the victim.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.71,0:02:31.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(541,644.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Suspect Repeating Nonsense
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.71,0:02:31.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(544.4,689.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Investigation With Possible Psychiatric Evaluation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.60,0:02:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Investigators will look into a\Npossible psychiatric evaluation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.84,0:02:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it's already been a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was quite a shock when Ranko brought\Nback Nagomi all covered in blood, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised that the made alien\Npeople backed off so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.10,0:02:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is that? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.28,0:02:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, it seems certain that\Nthey plan on attacking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll work on keeping watch again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.22,0:02:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think Nagomi will\Nbe coming back soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.86,0:02:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope she's doing okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:02:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anyone asks, Nagomi's\Nout sick again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko, are you okay? I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.10,0:03:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to focus on my duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.88,0:03:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that we have you back, Miss Minami,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.84,0:03:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we swear we're with you\Nall the way to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.18,0:03:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, to the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.22,0:03:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To outer space and beyond!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.64,0:03:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's less of us now, but\Nthe ones left are ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wussies will come around once\Nwe smash up that hog-filled pigsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.50,0:03:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't count on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.82,0:03:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.06,0:03:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugaki, you're the one who went and let\NMade Blam get all soft and weak, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.74,0:03:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just did what my old boss told me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.98,0:03:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My predecessor changed things\Naround after you got locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.36,0:03:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She realized money's more\Nimportant than strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lie to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.60,0:03:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The head I knew would've never put up with
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wuv Wuv Moonbeam getting\Ncrushed like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.48,0:03:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you lying slug!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.94,0:03:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, that's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you the truth, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.02,0:03:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what's real to me is different\Nfrom your version of the truth, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.62,0:04:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, for Pygmy, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.98,0:04:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's quite all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.48,0:04:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want a rohamptic time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.86,0:04:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to Oinky Doink.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking for a rohamptic time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.80,0:04:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to Oinky Doink Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.78,0:04:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, I'm a ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.00,0:04:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come get a discount coupon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.88,0:04:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,5 % off, good sirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.12,0:04:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nagomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is not Nagomi. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.70,0:04:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A humble cup of tea, my good lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.14,0:04:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know of a maid that goes\Nby the name of Nagomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.72,0:04:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is missing and we are\Nall very worried about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.86,0:04:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet this maid is\Nliving happily somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.74,0:04:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure this Nagomi you speak of\Njust wasn't cut out to be a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder then why Nagomi wanted\Nto be a maid in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.02,0:05:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if I were to guess, probably\Nbecause maids are so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.22,0:05:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe then do you suppose\Nshe's disillusioned now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.30,0:05:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's likely she's just\Ndisappointed in herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.30,0:05:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, what is it ninjas do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we throw kunai, ninja stars,\Nthere's smoke bombs, and nunchucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.36,0:05:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and fling poi everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.52,0:05:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And do you find that to be fun? It is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.58,0:05:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ninjas are the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.04,0:05:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as you do your ninjutsu\Ntraining and stay stealthy, it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.98,0:05:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike mates who love shootouts and guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.70,0:05:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, being a ninja is so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.92,0:05:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course being a ninja isn't fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.60,0:05:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A ninja isn't what I really want to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's just no use anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even at the most crucial\Nmoment, I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.90,0:05:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I relied on everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.36,0:06:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why, Nerula, I don't\Nwant to see someone else die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.22,0:06:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just because I'm useless\Nand couldn't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.06,0:06:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't be a maid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.84,0:06:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's precisely why, Nogomi,\NI want you to stay a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.14,0:06:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you're saying right now,\NI don't understand at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.66,0:06:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.20,0:06:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, as I'm but a humble ninja now,\NI will make my exit in a puff of smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.80,0:06:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found Nogomi. What? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.98,0:06:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still in town, but she's a ninja now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A ninja?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she's still an Akiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll kill her if they find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.84,0:06:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you bring her back?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.50,0:06:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because she's a ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.84,0:06:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not a maid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.38,0:06:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think we should do, Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's still employed by\Nthe Oinky-Doink, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.94,0:06:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She might come back, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.48,0:06:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, she's a ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.16,0:07:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hell, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi, be the maid you are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.84,0:07:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have the ninja rations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.30,0:07:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagonin, it's your very\Nfirst lord asking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.50,0:07:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lords, thank you so\Nmuch for choosing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.48,0:07:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm deeply honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.86,0:07:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm known as stealthy ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagonin, is it really you, Nagomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, um, were you at Oinky Doon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.34,0:07:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.68,0:07:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are all fans of Narula.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.52,0:07:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The maid called Ronko at Oinky\NDoon, told us where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.32,0:07:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said that you're hiding in stealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.10,0:07:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.01,0:07:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, really, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.98,0:07:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something we wanted to give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.96,0:07:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, my sister, Nerula.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.58,0:07:57.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(824.2,185.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}NERULA
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.58,0:07:57.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(590.2,607.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Dream big, go go
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.58,0:07:57.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(906.8,750.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}A maid for life!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.90,0:08:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't mean to make you cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.37,0:08:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.29,0:08:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it really is you, Nagomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.06,0:08:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.24,0:08:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, it's just I've never had\Na favorite mate die before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.51,0:08:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.43,0:08:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess this is what it's\Nlike to have a favorite die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.78,0:08:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nerula was my sweetheart. She was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.82,0:08:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,such a good maid, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.22,0:08:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She had a good set of\Nstandards that she adhered to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.42,0:08:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember her saying to dream big.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.38,0:08:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think, dream big, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.12,0:08:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think, dream big, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think, dream big, go, go, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.04,0:08:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because of me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.82,0:08:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nerula
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,died.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.90,0:08:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.33,0:08:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, please don't say that, Nogomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't come here to\Naccuse you or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.88,0:08:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nerula always said nice\Nthings about you, Nogomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.42,0:09:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said you'd make a\Nreally good maid one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nogomi will change what it means\Nto be a maid here in Akiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.22,0:09:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.06,0:09:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, you should keep\Nthis to remember her by.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.80,0:09:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going back to the cafe?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I decided to go back,\NI'd just drag everybody down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.46,0:09:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid such a terrible\Nshame. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do to repay Nerula\Nfor being my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:10:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been running that ramen joint\Nfor years and the people love
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that the taste is always the Same\Nbut actually that's not true I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,changed the flavor a lot some things\Nyou gotta change in Order to stay
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.62,0:10:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the same I don't quite understand\Nuh was this someone else's order?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.40,0:10:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks. Time again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.40,0:10:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some things you have to change\Nin order to stay the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.02,0:10:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two, four, six...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.04,0:10:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's like a lot of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.20,0:10:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got seventeen maids in all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.90,0:10:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go alert the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.76,0:10:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they're coming for us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.24,0:10:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's more than double our numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.20,0:10:54.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.11,0:10:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.12,0:10:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got my nails redone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:11:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I got a fishing pole I\Nnever had the chance to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.22,0:11:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.24,0:11:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to hunt us some pigs. Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.27,0:11:08.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(677.2,257)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.38,0:11:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.56,0:11:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got maids on the windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.34,0:11:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The swine of nowhere to run to. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.22,0:11:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then this is the only entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.06,0:11:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.38,0:11:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here, punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.22,0:11:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't we talk this out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.70,0:11:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's put our guns down and chat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.48,0:11:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got a hostage here, damn it! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.06,0:11:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think we'd give a\Ndamn about some stupid hostage?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.14,0:11:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.14,0:12:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cover the top floors first!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.70,0:12:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're shooting back like a\Nhundred for every bullet we shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.58,0:12:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So set means dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.56,0:12:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.62,0:12:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.82,0:12:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's from outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.82,0:12:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be some Creatureland backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all go take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.46,0:12:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.37,0:12:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if they send backup,\Nwe'll be cornered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.96,0:12:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay on the lookout.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.58,0:12:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All out of your foolish\Ntricks, huh, pig heads?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.32,0:12:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I ain't gonna let you die easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.76,0:12:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.70,0:12:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just got past the third floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:12:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got us trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.35,0:12:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yumechi, be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall charge out on the offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.08,0:13:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to use that chance\Nto take out their leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.38,0:13:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.29,0:13:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.21,0:13:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have too much firepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.38,0:13:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have enough\Nammunition left either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.40,0:13:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you go out now, you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.02,0:13:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That won't be a problem, if I\Ncan protect this cafe. Bronco.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.82,0:13:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on out, Piggies!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.54,0:13:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you? A ninja?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.82,0:13:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a ninja?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.73,0:13:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.65,0:13:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Minami looks like a ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.24,0:13:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not a ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a maid!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.84,0:13:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stops right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.86,0:13:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bronco, I want to be a maid after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.02,0:14:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done running.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can talk later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.50,0:14:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.90,0:14:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.16,0:14:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it! My turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.86,0:14:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Punk-ass bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.20,0:14:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fucking kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.08,0:14:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you hurt anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.52,0:14:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to live here! In Akiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.14,0:14:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at them go! We're\Ngoing too! Wait! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.06,0:15:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.54,0:15:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Monami!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.66,0:15:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.02,0:15:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let these pigs win!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.76,0:15:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you die, what's gonna\Nhappen to me an alien?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.44,0:15:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.84,0:15:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you run away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you, go after them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.82,0:15:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.48,0:15:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got a score to settle, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's all yours, Runkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.96,0:15:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please take care of things here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.64,0:15:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.76,0:15:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those buggers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.00,0:15:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to slaughter all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.56,0:15:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's call for backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.06,0:15:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as we can get more support,\Nwe can go back and win this damn war.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.18,0:15:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you just say, Yugaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.50,0:15:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The war's already begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.82,0:16:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can cut the tough talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.78,0:16:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You vermin can go ahead\Nand squash each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.30,0:16:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't give a damn about you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.46,0:16:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to be creatures from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.73,0:16:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.65,0:16:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Us aliens will join hands with\Nthe creatures and live in harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider it a merger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've come to an understanding\Nbeyond the Stargate, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.60,0:16:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Manami, thanks for all you did for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.38,0:16:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you at least die peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.58,0:16:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.14,0:16:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Mistress Manami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.84,0:16:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are so very useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.60,0:16:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, forget it. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mistress Menami! Beat\Nit. Go on. Now leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.92,0:17:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well now, little missy, here\Nto settle the score, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.00,0:17:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't forgive you for what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.46,0:17:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what you're gonna do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.54,0:17:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna kill me, hun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.76,0:17:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bet you can't, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.24,0:17:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're no cafe maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.12,0:17:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Missy, I am a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.22,0:17:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a stealthy ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.02,0:17:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a maid, a wannabe maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.96,0:17:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's a useless piece of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.54,0:17:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.45,0:17:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop, Bronco.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we continue to let her live,\Nshe'll just come attack us
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.96,0:17:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.87,0:17:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No doubt you've got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.24,0:17:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.88,0:18:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi, I need you to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.70,0:18:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.61,0:18:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think you're over there protecting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.00,0:18:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a fucking insult ninja\Nmaid move it my bad against
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.54,0:18:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your gun huh pitch me a\Ngood one you really want to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.04,0:18:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fight that badly an akiba\Nmaid has got to fight that's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.80,0:18:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not what being a maid is\Nabout you gotta be kidding
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.14,0:18:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me a maid would rather\Nhave a glorious death over
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,living in utter disgrace if\Nyou die all your masters will
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be sad won't they ramen\Nchanges over time and so should
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.98,0:18:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,akiba maids what the hell\Ndoes What does that mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.52,0:18:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ninja freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.62,0:18:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your sister must be crying down in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.94,0:18:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nerula said I should\Nstay just the way I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.90,0:18:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there's no point in us\Nkilling the likes of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.66,0:18:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fucking wuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.74,0:18:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just don't have what it\Ntakes to fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.14,0:18:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never forgive you,\Nbut I won't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.54,0:18:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of maid\NI'm going to be now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.62,0:18:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough of your shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.04,0:18:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bright-eyed youthful opinion time is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a real maid, then feel\Nthe lovey-dovey heart within you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.22,0:19:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a stealthy ninja, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.84,0:19:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd I have to hear that dumbass\Nshit from a fucking ninja, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.04,0:19:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you I'm a maid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.80,0:19:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lovey-dovey heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a big pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pig hunting's over now, ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.88,0:19:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to get back to outer space.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.30,0:19:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm now gonna be my own maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.16,0:19:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One that Nerula would be proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.36,0:19:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Nogomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:19:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a true maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.74,0:20:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back now.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.93,0:20:06.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(806,497)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Maidalien
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.92,0:20:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stinks like creatures in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.44,0:20:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugaki, I can see that\Ncollar around your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.80,0:20:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't underestimate me if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.68,0:20:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at you now, all big\Nand mighty with your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.58,0:20:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You afraid of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.49,0:20:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you make a\Nfool out of me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.52,0:20:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful now or you might start\Nsounding like a real maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.38,0:20:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get ready to become a stardust memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.44,0:20:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, that hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought it would\Nhurt this much to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.54,0:21:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ew.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.03,0:21:06.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1054,134.6)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Creatureland
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.28,0:21:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.84,0:21:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A job well done, Miss Mistress.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.54,0:21:19.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1283.2,272.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Is the maid
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.54,0:21:19.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1257.8,317)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}turf war over?!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.84,0:21:16.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(464.4,729.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}A Merger Between Creatureland and Maidalien?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.84,0:21:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so, Manami's plan to take\Nover Made Blam headquarters?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.59,0:21:19.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(459.4,748.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Possible Internal Rift Within Maidalien
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And wage war on the Creatureland group?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.06,0:21:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ended in absolute failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.10,0:21:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A faction of the Made Alien group\Nthat opposed the merger broke away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the second generation Hedyugaki\Nonce again returned to power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.74,0:21:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,having lost their Warhawks,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.18,0:21:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Made Alien had no choice but to agree\Nto all of Creatureland's demands!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.18,0:21:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dashing Yugaki's hopes for\Na merger on equal terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.16,0:21:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consequently, Creatureland swallowed\NMaid Alien whole in the merger,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.18,0:21:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the Maid Alien group\Neffectively disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one knows what became of Nanami,\Nthe Maid called the Crimson Supernova.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.94,0:22:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thus, Akihabara entered an era\Nof Creatureland group domination.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.72,0:22:07.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(230,551)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Individual Creatureland Group
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.72,0:22:07.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(288,626)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Café Performance Report
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.72,0:22:07.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(365,702)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.82,0:22:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They would have been\Nbetter off roasted whole.
